@title Cooling advice: sweep vent and fan places, show the best few, add one to Vents and fans
@area Heat
# A hot cabinet (VFD under PLC modules). Ctrl+K "Cooling advice and vent sweep" tries places and sizes in the 2D model; the window shows the best options with before and after, then Add puts the pair in the 3D Heat panel's Vents and fans list.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 30
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot cabinet-before
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Cooling advice and vent sweep
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
shot sweeping
wait_s 90
expect "Cooling advice"
expect "Model estimate"
expect "Tightest margin"
shot advice
check_layout
click_text "Add these two to Vents and fans"
wait 10
expect "Added"
shot added
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
shot in-3d
check_layout
